sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Browser
  participant A as /api/auth
  participant RL as authRateLimit
  participant PW as argon2id
  participant DB as Postgres (withSystem)

  rect rgb(238, 242, 255)
  Note over U,DB: SIGNUP creates a tenant
  U->>A: POST /signup {orgName, name, email, password}
  A->>RL: ≤ N requests / minute / IP ?
  A->>PW: hash(password)  (before opening a transaction)
  A->>DB: BEGIN
  A->>DB: email already a user? → 409 EMAIL_TAKEN
  A->>DB: slug = slugify(orgName), add -xxxxxx if taken
  A->>DB: INSERT organizations (plan free)
  A->>DB: INSERT users (role admin)
  A->>DB: INSERT refresh_tokens (new family_id, sha256(token))
  A->>DB: COMMIT
  A-->>U: 201 {accessToken, expiresIn, user, org} + Set-Cookie roomly_rt (httpOnly, SameSite=Strict, Path=/api/auth)
  end

  rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
  Note over U,DB: LOGIN
  U->>A: POST /login {email, password}
  A->>DB: SELECT user JOIN organization WHERE email (citext)
  A->>PW: verify(hash or DUMMY hash, password)
  Note right of PW: always one argon2 verify, so unknown emails take the same time
  alt wrong password or unknown email
    A-->>U: 401 Incorrect email or password (same message)
  else user deactivated
    A-->>U: 403 ACCOUNT_DISABLED
  else ok
    A->>DB: INSERT refresh_tokens (new family)
    A-->>U: 200 session + refresh cookie
  end
  end
